  "identity": "Trimmed NFC Unicode string, case-sensitive. Named energy roles have a fixed colour and pattern. Other keys use FNV-1a over UTF-16 code units followed by a 32-bit avalanche, which picks one of the six colours and one of the patterns, line dashes and markers. A recognised role followed by a colon and meter ID, such as gas:meter-two, keeps the role colour and takes its pattern, dash and marker from the key. No series count, order, visibility, theme colour or random input is used, so a series keeps its style when others are added, hidden or reordered.",
