  "limits": [
    "Six colours cannot tell more than six series apart. Every series also has a pattern, line dash and marker, a readable name and a value in the data table.",
    "GOV.UK advises limiting the number of colours. Prefer fewer visible series, the native legend and device detail views. Never delete readings or merge devices to stay under a limit.",
    "Some colours have low contrast with a white or dark surface (for example Orange tint 25% on white, Blue shade 50% on dark). There the label, pattern or line style carries the meaning."
